					{
						m_id = 986215674
					}
					m_sNote = ""
					m_commentText = "Used in the \"HoldItem\" holdtype. References a 100-frame (*) animation, so that every digit from 0.00 to 1.00 can land cleanly on the full pose, rather than in-between. Going halfway between specific poses e.g. 0.125 is perfectly valid, though! The relevant parameter is holdtype_pose_hand (float).\n\n(* Currently only has 18 poses as of the time of writing this comment node.) ALSO DEFINES THE POS/ROT OF THE HOLD_* BONES."
